abstract: "Tier B Pavlovian (respondent) procedure extension for contingency-dsl. Provides 26 Pavlovian conditioning primitives (blocking, overshadowing, latent inhibition, renewal, reinstatement, etc.) that plug into the contingency-dsl Core via the Respondent extension point."
